    <string name="power_saver_tips_title">More ways to save battery</string>
    <string name="power_saver_tips">• Connect the phone to the car with a cable. Android Auto then charges it while it projects, instead of draining it.\n• Wireless Android Auto keeps Wi-Fi and Bluetooth busy; it costs noticeably more than a cable.\n• Play as music (sound only): the screen and the video decoder get to rest, and YouTube uses the lowest quality.\n• Download what you will play. Streaming keeps the mobile radio awake; a downloaded song does not.\n• Let the phone screen go dark while driving; Android Auto does not need it.\n• Switch off what you do not use: Share, lyrics and captions, on-device subtitles.</string>

